#: ../../source/docs/sitl-on-windows-wsl.rst:5
#: d5be2d10c5c046899b8c4b4762a30f4c
msgid "SITL on Windows using WSL"
msgstr "在 Windows 上使用 WSL 运行 SITL"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-on-windows-wsl.rst:7
#: 7c75ae9c7e754ec09b9c423e3708769d
msgid ""
"Before following these instructions please following :ref:`Setting up the "
"Build Environment using WSL <building-setup-windows>` for Windows 10 and 11."
"  For Windows10 users the sections detailing :ref:`installing XWindows or "
"VcXsrv <building-setup-windows10_XWindows>` are necessary for installation."
msgstr ""
"按照这些说明操作之前，请先按照 :ref:`使用 WSL 设置构建环境 <building-setup-windows>` 的说明为 Windows "
"10 和 11 完成设置。对于 Windows 10 用户，需要完成 :ref:`安装 XWindows 或 VcXsrv <building-"
"setup-windows10_XWindows>` 章节的安装步骤。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-on-windows-wsl.rst:9
#: d7f5530b3aa4469b911ebedbe2cea7db
msgid ""
"Once the above have been completed, using SITL under Windows WSL is nearly "
"the same as :ref:`Setting up SITL on Linux <setting-up-sitl-on-linux>`"
msgstr ""
"完成上述步骤后，在 Windows WSL 下使用 SITL 与 :ref:`在 Linux 上设置 SITL <setting-up-sitl-on-"
"linux>` 几乎相同。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-on-windows-wsl.rst:16
#: 9caac23735b0425f852d3c3dadeceda0
msgid "Running SITL"
msgstr "运行 SITL"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-on-windows-wsl.rst:18
#: 3975377d346144659f41cc29a64abe4a
msgid ""
"Open an Ubuntu terminal under WSL, or use the :ref:`VSCode <editing-the-"
"code-with-vscode>` Terminal"
msgstr ""
"在 WSL 下打开 Ubuntu 终端，或使用 :ref:`VSCode <editing-the-code-with-vscode>` 终端。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-on-windows-wsl.rst:20
#: d37cb89e7995463db466cb8ad2217ea2
msgid ""
"Navigate to one of the vehicle directories (in this case Copter) and call "
"``sim_vehicle.py`` to start SITL."
msgstr "导航到某个飞行器目录（此处为 Copter），然后调用 ``sim_vehicle.py`` 启动 SITL。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-on-windows-wsl.rst:31
#: 3a9a241cce624c53bfbd83671925f73d
msgid "SITL and *MAVProxy* will start. *MAVProxy* displays three windows:"
msgstr "SITL 和 *MAVProxy* 将启动。*MAVProxy* 显示三个窗口："

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-on-windows-wsl.rst:33
#: 85b65e3852e54a6abf1d9f1bfe3d1d6f
msgid "command prompt in which you enter commands to SITL"
msgstr "命令提示符，用于向 SITL 输入命令"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-on-windows-wsl.rst:34
#: 2a53d8680b484ecbba9b1a5bc240e291
msgid "console which displays current status and messages"
msgstr "控制台，显示当前状态和消息"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-on-windows-wsl.rst:35
#: 7b7c52a080934b7cba5c226adacf804c
msgid ""
"map that shows the current position of the vehicle and can be used (via "
"right-click) to control vehicle movement and missions."
msgstr "地图，显示飞行器当前位置，可通过右键点击控制飞行器移动和任务。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-on-windows-wsl.rst:44
#: 394ff00749794c72b6c8158a2704ab0c
msgid ""
"It is useful to arrange the windows as shown above, so you can observe the "
"status and send commands at the same time."
msgstr "建议按上图所示排列窗口，以便同时观察状态和发送命令。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-on-windows-wsl.rst:47
#: 217a96da017a403e82a08e8a58ebca6e
msgid ""
"Send commands to SITL from the command prompt and observe the results on the"
" map."
msgstr "从命令提示符向 SITL 发送命令，并在地图上观察结果。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-on-windows-wsl.rst:49
#: 7f0e46441f5f420c946d53277c3a5ee4
msgid ""
"For example, change to GUIDED mode, arm the throttle, and then takeoff:"
msgstr "例如，切换到 GUIDED 模式，解锁油门，然后起飞："

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-on-windows-wsl.rst:57
#: 13aeb8ebda3443db9ea2fd58573c9079
msgid "Watch the altitude increase on the console."
msgstr "在控制台上观察高度的增加。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-on-windows-wsl.rst:61
#: 768de2c16a8f443eaa7f8119ee913703
msgid ""
"Takeoff must start within 15 seconds of arming, or the motors will disarm."
msgstr "起飞必须在解锁后 15 秒内开始，否则电机将上锁。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-on-windows-wsl.rst:63
#: ae886da4f99f49b4a8dbe97d2ef9adea
msgid "Change to CIRCLE mode and set the radius to 2000cm"
msgstr "切换到 CIRCLE 模式并将半径设置为 2000 厘米。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-on-windows-wsl.rst:71
#: 4b83066e909b4b52b7919cb47c0572b8
msgid "Watch the copter circle on the map."
msgstr "在地图上观察多旋翼飞行器绕圈飞行。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-on-windows-wsl.rst:73
#: 68f4cbe34dac4171a21faf8c18c0c930
msgid "When you're ready to land you can set the mode to RTL (or LAND):"
msgstr "准备降落时，可以将模式设置为 RTL（或 LAND）："

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-on-windows-wsl.rst:79
#: d7d7c34cca014cca9abb75d6f95f35d9
msgid ""
"This is a very basic example. For links to more information on what you can "
"do with SITL and MAVProxy see the section: :ref:`Next Steps <sitl-on-"
"windows-wsl_next_steps>`."
msgstr ""
"这是一个非常基础的示例。有关 SITL 和 MAVProxy 更多功能的链接，请参阅 :ref:`后续步骤 <sitl-on-windows-"
"wsl_next_steps>` 章节。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-on-windows-wsl.rst:83
#: c034d36e9c3c409c86bfefc70368f00f
msgid "Connecting with another GCS"
msgstr "连接其他地面控制站"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-on-windows-wsl.rst:85
#: fa4751d45e5a40a6a9464d83018968ec
msgid ""
"Mission Planner will often automatically connect to SITL if started (or re-"
"started) after the MAVProxy console and map have appeared."
msgstr "在 MAVProxy 控制台和地图出现后，如果启动（或重新启动）Mission Planner，它通常会自动连接到 SITL。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-on-windows-wsl.rst:87
#: 3d697f22856748a98279130f45c299ba
msgid ""
"If the above does not work you can attach multiple additional ground control"
" stations to SITL from *MAVProxy*. The simulated vehicle can then be "
"controlled and viewed through any attached GCS."
msgstr ""
"如果上述方法不起作用，您可以从 *MAVProxy* 将多个额外的地面控制站连接到 SITL。仿真飞行器随后可通过任何连接的地面控制站进行控制和查看。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-on-windows-wsl.rst:90
#: 66d25cac48144b95ae53d859f535d18e
msgid ""
"First use the ``output`` command on the *MAVProxy command prompt* to "
"determine where *MAVProxy* is sending packets:"
msgstr "首先在 *MAVProxy 命令提示符* 中使用 ``output`` 命令查看 *MAVProxy* 正在向哪里发送数据包："

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-on-windows-wsl.rst:100
#: c54437bccd0b42e697a7cc4450680267
msgid ""
"This tells us that we can connect *Mission Planner* to either UDP port 14550"
" or 14551, as shown on the dialog below."
msgstr "这告诉我们可以将 *Mission Planner* 连接到 UDP 端口 14550 或 14551，如下图对话框所示。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-on-windows-wsl.rst:106
#: 16472f5ea73a4c868dcbb6f65963e33d
msgid "Mission Planner: Connecting to a UDPPort"
msgstr "Mission Planner：连接到 UDP 端口"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-on-windows-wsl.rst:108
#: 57c66aeeb06e4ef3b557b51c4788de80
msgid ""
"*Mission Planner* can then be used to control the simulated vehicle in "
"exactly the same way as though it were a real vehicle. We can reproduce the "
"previous \"takeoff-circle-land\" example as shown below:"
msgstr ""
"*Mission Planner* 随后可以完全按照操控真实飞行器的方式控制仿真飞行器。我们可以重现之前的「起飞-绕圈-降落」示例，如下所示："

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-on-windows-wsl.rst:115
#: 4128d71bf79b415aa16005c60c397360
msgid "Next Steps"
msgstr "后续步骤"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-on-windows-wsl.rst:117
#: c8610bc9fe8a459291578c4e048e7a05
msgid ""
"SITL and MAVProxy can do a whole lot more than shown here, including "
"manually guiding the vehicle, and creating and running missions. To find out"
" more:"
msgstr "SITL 和 MAVProxy 的功能远不止于此，包括手动引导飞行器、创建和运行任务等。要了解更多："

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-on-windows-wsl.rst:121
#: efa17f4b4e364b70ac90ede7830f751d
msgid "Read the :ref:`MAVProxy documentation <mavproxy:home>`."
msgstr "阅读 :ref:`MAVProxy 文档 <mavproxy:home>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-on-windows-wsl.rst:122
#: 4024d68e39e0432a81a206aa43656bf1
msgid ""
"See :ref:`Using SITL for ArduPilot Testing <using-sitl-for-ardupilot-"
